      "text": "{\n  \"certificate\": {\n    \"number\": \"R49/2013-A-SK1-23.02\",\n    \"scheme\": \"A\",\n    \"page_total\": 13,\n    \"member_state\": \"Slovakia\",\n    \"oiml_issuer_id\": \"SK1\"\n  },\n  \"certified_type\": {\n    \"category\": \"Water meter\",\n    \"type_designations\": [\"QALCOSONIC W1\"],\n    \"module_designation\": null,\n    \"description\": \"Electronic water meter with integrated calculator and indicating device. Legal data displayed: total measured volume (m³) and flow rate (m³/h). Further displays available via the configuration program \\\"W1 TOOL\\\" (forward flow volume, total reverse flow volume, water temperature, date, real time, status error code, accumulated volume on set day and time, segment tests, user indication number, control number, verification mode). The calculator and indicating device automatically detect fault conditions during measurement and stop the measurement with an alarm indication (accountable alarms). Integrated RF transceiver (Wireless M-Bus, LoRa, NFC, Radio NB IoT); no legally relevant data can be altered via these interfaces. Software version and checksum are indicated on the data plate.\"\n  },\n  \"model_family\": {\n    \"family_name\": \"QALCOSONIC W1\",\n    \"models\": [\n      {\"model_id\": \"DN15-Q3=1.6-R80\"},\n      {\"model_id\": \"DN15-Q3=1.6-R160\"},\n      {\"model_id\": \"DN15-Q3=1.6-R250\"},\n      {\"model_id\": \"DN15-Q3=1.6-R315\"},\n      {\"model_id\": \"DN15-Q3=1.6-R400\"},\n      {\"model_id\": \"DN15-Q3=2.5-R80\"},\n      {\"model_id\": \"DN15-Q3=2.5-R160\"},\n      {\"model_id\": \"DN15-Q3=2.5-R250\"},\n      {\"model_id\": \"DN15-Q3=2.5-R400\"},\n      {\"model_id\": \"DN15-Q3=2.5-R800\"},\n      {\"model_id\": \"DN20-Q3=2.5-R80\"},\n      {\"model_id\": \"DN20-Q3=2.5-R160\"},\n      {\"model_id\": \"DN20-Q3=2.5-R250\"},\n      {\"model_id\": \"DN20-Q3=2.5-R400\"},\n      {\"model_id\": \"DN20-Q3=4-R80\"},\n      {\"model_id\": \"DN20-Q3=4-R160\"},\n      {\"model_id\": \"D